ration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-28T04:32:17Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "### Quiz end", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-28T04:33:05Z", "username": "Saumay", "text": "Wow", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-28T04:33:51Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "The Tereshkova image reminds me of another fact which I came across while framing the Gagarin question", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-28T04:34:00Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Let me share it", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-28T04:34:54Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "If you look at photos of Gagarin on the day of his flight, the letters \"CCCP\" (USSR) are hand-painted on his helmet.\nThese weren't originally there. Just minutes before he left for the launch pad, an engineer realized that if Gagarin landed in a remote field, people might mistake his orange suit for that of a foreign spy (like U-2 pilot Gary Powers, who had been shot down a year earlier). An engineer grabbed a brush and some red paint and quickly lettered the helmet while Gagarin was already wearing it. ‎image omitted", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-28T04:35:20Z", "username": "Dr.Namrata Srinivasan", "text": "Such a fun format!! @⁨~Pavan Pamidimarri⁩\nAnd great qotd as ush @⁨Abhishek Vats⁩", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-28T04:36:49Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "But then thought Buckingham palace one was slightly not what you expect kind of an incidence.\nA Russian in UK and then queen being nice for a change 😂🙈", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-28T04:38:59Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Fascinating that they didn’t anticipate that the photo of him would go viral and it was important for propaganda purposes to have “CCCP” prominently visible in all shots of the first-ever astronaut.", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]